## Protocol

### Setup
- Environment: single CPU machine, OS + kernel + CPU model recorded, Python 3.14, pin versions.
- Install: jax, jaxlib (CPU), pettingzoo[mpe] (which pulls gymnasium), numpy. Versions pinned in a requirements.txt.
